Attribution
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The estimator and intervention-set construction code in this repository is
derived from the ULTR-bias-toolkit by Philipp Hager
(https://github.com/philipphager/ultr-bias-toolkit), an open-source project for
bias estimation in unbiased learning to rank. The AdjacentChain, AllPairs, and
Pivot estimators and the intervention-set builder originate from that toolkit
and have been adapted and extended here with the count-only surrogate
inverse-variance (min and harmonic) weighting schemes introduced in the paper.

The intervention-harvesting methodology and the original (uniform) weighting
baseline are due to:

    Aman Agarwal, Ivan Zaitsev, Xuanhui Wang, Cheng Li, Marc Najork, and
    Thorsten Joachims. "Estimating Position Bias without Intrusive
    Interventions." WSDM 2019.

Please cite both the original toolkit / method and the CIKM 2026 paper (see
CITATION.cff) when using this software.
